---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import ResourcePageLayout from '../../../layouts/ResourcePageLayout.astro';
---

<ResourcePageLayout
  title="Buy Bitcoin"
  description="How to buy your first satoshis in Denmark. A step-by-step guide to getting started."
  lang="en"
>
  <section class="intro">
    <p>There are several ways to acquire bitcoin. Some services let you <a href="/en/get-started/earn-bitcoin">earn bitcoin</a>, but the most common approach is to buy through an online exchange. Further down the page you'll find a selection of recommended ones.</p>

    <p>If you want to start acquiring bitcoin the right and safe way, we've put together a <a href="/en/get-started/guide"><strong>simple step-by-step guide</strong></a> that walks you through the most important steps — from buying to safe storage. Follow it and you'll have a solid setup you can always build on.</p>

    <p>Always be aware that many exchanges also sell and advertise other cryptocurrencies. Some even try to present various "variants" of bitcoin, but there is only one real bitcoin (BTC). It is also increasingly possible to trade directly peer to peer (P2P).</p>

    <div class="warning-box">
      <strong>⚠️ Important:</strong> There is only one real bitcoin (BTC). Be aware that many exchanges also sell and advertise other cryptocurrencies that are not bitcoin.
    </div>

    <div class="info-box">
      <p>Once you've bought bitcoin, it's important to send it to your own wallet, where you control your private keys. We recommend getting a hardware wallet. See our overview of recommended models here: <a href="/en/get-started/hardware-wallets"><strong>Hardware Wallets</strong></a>. You can also read more about safe storage here: <a href="/en/get-started/bitcoin-storage"><strong>Bitcoin storage</strong></a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="guide-link">
    <a href="/en/get-started/guide" class="guide-button" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
      📖 Simple step-by-step guide
    </a>
  </section>

  <div class="quick-links">
    <a href="/en/get-started/hardware-wallets" class="quick-link-btn">Hardware wallets</a>
    <a href="/en/get-started/privacy-best-practices" class="quick-link-btn">Privacy &amp; good habits</a>
    <a href="/en/get-started/bitcoin-storage" class="quick-link-btn">Bitcoin storage</a>
  </div>

  <section class="services-section">
    <h2>Online exchanges</h2>
    <p class="section-intro">Some of these platforms work both on desktop and as an app, while others come in only one form. It's a good idea to visit their website and read up on them before you choose.</p>

    <div class="security-note">
      *Always check that you're on the correct URL before using a service. And always use two-factor authentication (2FA).
    </div>

    <div class="service-grid">
      <div class="service-card">
        <Image src="/images/logos/bullbitcoin.webp" alt="BullBitcoin" width={500} height={117} class="service-logo" />
        <h3><a href="https://app.bullbitcoin.com/registration/enogtyve" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">BullBitcoin</a></h3>
        <p>BullBitcoin is a platform where you can easily buy bitcoin. You transfer EUR via your bank and buy bitcoin, which is sent straight to your wallet.</p>

        <div class="promo-code">
          <span class="promo-label">Referral code:</span>
          <code>enogtyve</code>
          <span class="promo-benefit">25% off fees</span>
        </div>

        <a href="https://app.bullbitcoin.com/registration/enogtyve" class="service-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          Visit BullBitcoin →
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="service-card">
        <Image src="/images/logos/relai_w.png" alt="Relai" width={6900} height={6880} class="service-logo" />
        <h3><a href="https://relai.app/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Relai</a></h3>
        <p>With Relai you can buy bitcoin by credit card or bank transfer (EUR). You can also set up recurring buys — for example, a fixed amount once a month.</p>

        <div class="promo-code">
          <span class="promo-label">Referral code:</span>
          <code>enogtyve</code>
          <span class="promo-benefit">0.5% off fees</span>
        </div>

        <a href="https://relai.app/" class="service-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          Visit Relai →
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="service-card">
        <Image src="/images/logos/bringin.svg" alt="Bringin" width={343} height={89} class="service-logo" />
        <h3><a href="https://spend.bringin.xyz/signup?affiliate=ID1T71MG5S" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Bringin</a></h3>
        <p>With Bringin you can buy bitcoin via bank transfer (EUR). Bringin also offers other features, including a debit card.</p>

        <div class="promo-code">
          <span class="promo-label">Referral code:</span>
          <code>enogtyve</code>
          <span class="promo-benefit">Reduced fees for the first 3 months</span>
        </div>

        <a href="https://spend.bringin.xyz/signup?affiliate=ID1T71MG5S" class="service-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          Visit Bringin →
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="services-section">
    <h2>Peer to peer (P2P)</h2>
    <p class="section-intro">P2P platforms help buyers and sellers find each other and facilitate the trade itself. It can feel a little more involved than a regular exchange, but you usually don't have to share much personal information.</p>

    <div class="service-grid">
      <div class="service-card">
        <Image src="/images/logos/peachbitcoin.svg" alt="Peach Bitcoin" width={1149} height={352} class="service-logo" />
        <h3><a href="https://peachbitcoin.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Peach Bitcoin</a></h3>
        <p>A P2P marketplace for buying and selling bitcoin directly between users.</p>

        <div class="promo-code">
          <span class="promo-label">Referral code:</span>
          <code>PRD3C4</code>
        </div>

        <a href="https://peachbitcoin.com/" class="service-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          Visit Peach Bitcoin →
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="service-card">
        <Image src="/images/logos/bisq.svg" alt="Bisq" width={246} height={85} class="service-logo" />
        <h3><a href="https://bisq.network/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Bisq</a></h3>
        <p>An open-source P2P desktop client for buying and selling bitcoin.</p>

        <a href="https://bisq.network/" class="service-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          Visit Bisq →
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="service-card">
        <Image src="/images/logos/hodlhodl.png" alt="HodlHodl" width={1500} height={473} class="service-logo" />
        <h3><a href="https://hodlhodl.com/join/PJ2Y" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">HodlHodl</a></h3>
        <p>A P2P trading platform that helps facilitate trades between buyer and seller.</p>

        <a href="https://hodlhodl.com/join/PJ2Y" class="service-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          Visit HodlHodl →
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <a href="#" class="back-to-top">
    ↑ Back to top
  </a>
</ResourcePageLayout>

<style>
  .intro {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .intro p {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .warning-box {
    background: rgba(247, 147, 26, 0.1);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--primary);
    padding: var(--space-md);
    margin: var(--space-md) 0;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }

  .info-box {
    background: var(--background-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding: var(--space-md);
    margin: var(--space-md) 0;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }

  .quick-links {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--space-md);
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .quick-link-btn {
    display: inline-block;
    background: var(--primary);
    color: #000;
    padding: var(--space-sm) var(--space-md);
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-weight: bold;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .quick-link-btn:hover {
    opacity: 0.85;
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .guide-link {
    margin: var(--space-lg) 0;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .guide-button {
    display: inline-block;
    background: var(--primary);
    color: #000;
    padding: var(--space-md) var(--space-lg);
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-weight: bold;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .guide-button:hover {
    opacity: 0.85;
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .services-section {
    margin: var(--space-xl) 0;
  }

  .services-section h2 {
    color: var(--primary);
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
    padding-bottom: var(--space-sm);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(247, 147, 26, 0.2);
  }

  .section-intro {
    color: var(--text-light);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .security-note {
    background: var(--background-card);
    padding: var(--space-sm) var(--space-md);
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: #ff4444;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .service-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
    gap: var(--space-md);
    margin-top: var(--space-md);
  }

  .service-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
    border: 2px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: var(--space-md);
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .service-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--primary);
    transform: translateY(-4px);
  }

  .service-logo {
    height: 48px;
    max-width: 140px;
    object-fit: contain;
    object-position: left;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .service-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .service-card h3 a:hover {
    opacity: 0.8;
  }

  .service-card p {
    color: var(--text-light);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
    flex: 1;
  }

  .promo-code {
    background: var(--background);
    border: 1px solid var(--primary);
    padding: var(--space-sm);
    border-radius: 4px;
    margin: var(--space-md) 0;
  }

  .promo-label {
    color: var(--text-light);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    margin-right: var(--space-xs);
  }

  .promo-code code {
    background: var(--primary);
    color: #000;
    padding: 0.3rem 0.6rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-weight: bold;
    font-size: 1rem;
    margin: 0 var(--space-xs);
  }

  .promo-benefit {
    display: block;
    color: var(--primary);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    margin-top: var(--space-xs);
  }

  .service-link {
    display: inline-block;
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-top: auto;
    padding-top: var(--space-sm);
    transition: opacity 0.2s ease;
  }

  .service-link:hover {
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  @media (max-width: 567px) {
    .service-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .quick-links {
      flex-direction: column;
    }
  }
</style>
